---
/**
 * About body, locale-aware.
 *
 * Demographics are readable prose with inline figures, NOT a stat-card wall
 * (§13.6, §35). Every figure carries its source and year.
 *
 * Only VERIFIED facts appear. Elevation is deliberately absent; the
 * barangays-around-the-Sound count is absent because sources conflict; the "no
 * land border" claim is absent because only 5 of 31 barangays were checked
 * (RESEARCH.md §2.3–2.4, §3.1).
 */
import Section from '@/components/Section.astro'
import Placeholder from '@/components/Placeholder.astro'
import { getDictionary, type Locale } from '@/lib/i18n'
import { SITE } from '@/lib/content/site'
import { isPlaceholder } from '@/lib/content/placeholder'

interface Props {
  locale: Locale
}

const { locale } = Astro.props
const t = getDictionary(locale)
const fil = locale === 'fil'
const prose = 'max-width:var(--measure);display:grid;gap:var(--space-4)'
const pop = SITE.population2020.toLocaleString('en-PH')
const pa = SITE.protectedArea.areaHectares.toLocaleString('en-PH')
---

<Section divider={false} class="section--airy">
  <h1 class="page-title">{t.nav.about}</h1>
</Section>

<Section title={fil ? 'Ang pulo' : 'The island'} titleId="island">
  <div style={prose}>
    {
      fil ? (
        <>
          <p>
            Ang Barangay Tumbod ay hindi nasa isang pulo — <strong>ito ang pulo</strong>. Ang
            Tuluran, na tinatawag ding Tumbod, ay may sukat na <span class="figure">6.4</span> ×
            <span class="figure"> 3.2</span> kilometro at nakaharang sa bukana ng Malampaya Sound.
          </p>
          <p>
            Dahil dito, ang barangay namin ang <em>pintuan</em> ng Sound. Ang bawat bangkang papasok
            o palabas sa isa sa pinakamayamang pangisdaan ng bansa ay dumadaan sa isa sa dalawang
            daanang-tubig sa magkabilang gilid namin:
          </p>
        </>
      ) : (
        <>
          <p>
            Barangay Tumbod is not <em>on</em> an island — <strong>it is the island</strong>.
            Tuluran, also called Tumbod, measures <span class="figure">6.4</span> ×
            <span class="figure"> 3.2</span> kilometres and lies across the mouth of Malampaya Sound.
          </p>
          <p>
            That makes our barangay the <em>gate</em> of the Sound. Every boat entering or leaving
            one of the country’s richest fishing grounds passes through one of the two channels on
            either side of us:
          </p>
        </>
      )
    }
    <ul style="padding-inline-start:var(--space-5)">
      <li>
        <span class="is-water">Blockade Strait</span> — <span class="figure">1.1</span> km,{' '}
        {fil ? 'nasa kanluran' : 'to the west'}.
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="is-water">Endeavor Strait</span> — <span class="figure">0.2</span> km{' '}
        {fil ? 'lamang, nasa silangan' : 'only, to the east'}.
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      {
        fil
          ? 'Walang kalsadang papunta rito. Bangka ang lahat ng biyahe.'
          : 'There is no road here. Every trip is by boat.'
      }
    </p>
  </div>
</Section>

<Section title={fil ? 'Populasyon' : 'Population'} titleId="population">
  <div style={prose}>
    <p>
      {fil ? 'May ' : 'There are '}
      <span class="figure">{pop}</span>
      {
        fil
          ? ' katao sa Tumbod ayon sa senso ng PSA noong 2020 — '
          : ' of us in Tumbod per the PSA 2020 census — '
      }
      <span class="figure">{SITE.populationShareOfTaytay}%</span>
      {fil ? ' ng buong Taytay.' : ' of all Taytay.'}
    </p>
    <p>
      {fil ? 'Noong 2015, ' : 'In 2015 there were '}
      <span class="figure">1,489</span>
      {fil ? ' kami sa ' : ' of us across '}
      <span class="figure">{SITE.households2015}</span>
      {fil ? ' na sambahayan — mga ' : ' households — about '}
      <span class="figure">{SITE.averageHouseholdSize2015}</span>
      {fil ? ' katao bawat bahay. ' : ' people per house. '}
      {
        fil
          ? 'Ang pinakamaraming pangkat ng edad noon ay ang 5 hanggang 9 na taong gulang, '
          : 'The largest age band was 5 to 9 years old, '
      }
      <span class="figure">208</span>
      {fil ? ' bata o ' : ' children, or '}
      <span class="figure">13.97%</span>
      {
        fil
          ? ' ng populasyon. Bata ang barangay na ito.'
          : ' of the population. This is a young barangay.'
      }
    </p>
    <p style="font-size:var(--text-sm);color:var(--ink-muted)">
      {t.common.source}: Philippine Statistics Authority, 2015 &amp; 2020 Census of Population and
      Housing.
    </p>
  </div>
</Section>

<Section title="Malampaya Sound" titleId="malampaya">
  <div style={prose}>
    <p>
      {fil ? 'Nasa loob kami ng ' : 'We sit inside the '}
      <strong>{SITE.protectedArea.name}</strong> ({SITE.protectedArea.abbreviation}),
      {fil ? ' idineklara sa ilalim ng ' : ' declared under '}
      {SITE.protectedArea.proclamation}.
      {fil ? ' Sakop nito ang ' : ' It covers '}
      <span class="figure">{pa}</span>
      {
        fil
          ? ' ektarya ng lupa at tubig sa Taytay at San Vicente.'
          : ' hectares of land and water across Taytay and San Vicente.'
      }
    </p>
    <p>
      {
        fil
          ? 'Ang Sound ay isa sa pinakamayamang pangisdaan sa Pilipinas, at tanging dito matatagpuan ang Irrawaddy dolphin sa buong bansa. Halos 70% ng mga taong nakatira sa loob ng protektadong lugar ay umaasa sa pangingisda.'
          : 'The Sound is one of the richest fishing grounds in the Philippines, and the only known habitat of the Irrawaddy dolphin in the country. Around 70% of people living inside the protected area depend on fishing.'
      }
    </p>
    <p>
      {
        fil
          ? 'Ang bahura sa Tumbod at Liminangcong ay sinuri para sa konserbasyon — kabuuang 4,001.17 ektarya. Ang biomass ng isda sa bahura ng Tumbod ay 41.94 MT/km², mas mababa kaysa sa Liminangcong na 59.94 MT/km².'
          : 'The reefs of Tumbod and Liminangcong have been assessed for conservation — 4,001.17 hectares in total. Reef fish biomass at Tumbod is 41.94 MT/km², lower than Liminangcong’s 59.94 MT/km².'
      }
    </p>
    <p style="font-size:var(--text-sm);color:var(--ink-muted)">
      {t.common.source}: DENR-BMB; Sustainable Coral Reef Ecosystem Management in Bacuit Bay, El
      Nido and Outer Malampaya Sound, Taytay, Palawan.
    </p>
  </div>
</Section>

<Section title={fil ? 'Kasaysayan' : 'History'} titleId="history">
  <div style={prose}>
    <p>
      {
        fil
          ? 'Kulang pa ang naitalang kasaysayan ng barangay sa website na ito. Hindi namin ito pupunan ng hula.'
          : 'The barangay’s recorded history is not yet on this website. We will not fill it with guesses.'
      }
    </p>
    {isPlaceholder(SITE.foundedYear) && <Placeholder value={SITE.foundedYear} display="block" />}
  </div>
</Section>
